          "type": 1,
          "left": 46.8,
          "top": 25.92,
          "width": 856.8,
          "height": 24.48,
          "text": "读懂世界地图 · 先把“看起来”与“实际”分开",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "name": "Text 1",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 46.8,
          "top": 67.68,
          "width": 864.0,
          "height": 68.4,
          "text": "格陵兰为什么在某些世界地图上显得巨大？",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "name": "Text 2",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 46.8,
          "top": 499.68,
          "width": 828.0,
          "height": 18.0,
          "text": "PROJ 9.9 墨卡托公式；Esri ArcGIS Pro 3.6《墨卡托》",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "name": "Text 3",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 864.0,
          "top": 498.96,
          "width": 50.4,
          "height": 20.16,
          "text": "1 / 7",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "name": "Text 4",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 50.4,
          "top": 162.0,
          "width": 522.0,
          "height": 104.4,
          "text": "因为墨卡托投影越靠近两极，\r放大越严重。",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "name": "Text 5",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 50.4,
          "top": 291.6,
          "width": 525.6,
          "height": 79.2,
          "text": "格陵兰位于高纬度，所以纸上的面积\r会显得不成比例；这不是所有地图的共同问题。",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "name": "Shape 6",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 622.8,
          "top": 158.4,
          "width": 284.4,
          "height": 270.0,
          "text": null,
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "name": "Text 7",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 648.0,
          "top": 185.04,
          "width": 234.0,
          "height": 36.0,
          "text": "真实面积相比",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "name": "Text 8",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 648.0,
          "top": 238.32,
          "width": 234.0,
          "height": 74.16,
          "text": "约14倍",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "name": "Text 9",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 648.0,
          "top": 335.52,
          "width": 234.0,
          "height": 43.2,
          "text": "非洲 ÷ 格陵兰",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "name": "Text 10",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 50.4,
          "top": 434.16,
          "width": 849.6,
          "height": 32.4,
          "text": "面积来源：IndexMundi、Britannica；使用约数。",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slide": 2,
      "image": "slide-02.png",
      "shapes": [
        {
          "id": 2,
          "name": "Text 0",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 46.8,
          "top": 25.92,
          "width": 856.8,
          "height": 24.48,
          "text": "真实面积 · 同一尺度才可比较",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "name": "Text 1",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 46.8,
          "top": 67.68,
          "width": 864.0,
          "height": 68.4,
          "text": "非洲的真实面积约为格陵兰的14倍",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "name": "Text 2",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 46.8,
          "top": 499.68,
          "width": 828.0,
          "height": 18.0,
          "text": "IndexMundi《格陵兰面积》（页面更新于2021年）；Britannica《非洲》",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "name": "Text 3",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 864.0,
          "top": 498.96,
          "width": 50.4,
          "height": 20.16,
          "text": "2 / 7",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "name": "Text 4",
          "type": 1,
          "left": 50.4,
          "top": 146.16,
          "width": 561.6,
          "height": 30.96,
          "text": "面积（百万平方公里，约数）",
          "hasTable": false,
          "hasChart": false
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "name": "Chart 0",
